Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone wished to go to\Nheaven, there may be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but how does one actually do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I must know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, I wrote down\Nthe process in a notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But, before I could access\Nthat book and find out how...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For the next 20 years, I was forced to\Nwait, to finally obtain Jotaro's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read the contents of\Nthe notebook in his disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit's goal relies\Non their ability to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,steal people's stands by\Nmaking them materialize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe my\Nfather is actually dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he'll be okay if\NI can get his stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me, you insolent brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:00:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This changes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when Starplanum returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.14,0:01:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,your father would be nothing\Nmore than a broken puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And the user still has\Nmy father's memory disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's the best chance I'm gonna\Nget to discover who they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Using your unique abilities, there\Nis something I would like to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that belong to a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whose bone is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say it belongs to\Na very old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The bone of my dear friend, the Great Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out! We're coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we're not going to be able to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out, we're going to be your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't stop beating. Don't stop beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Julie, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a stand ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is, then obviously Palesnake\Nmust have put a disc into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, please, take FF and\Nget the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This problem is mine and mine alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with either of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, no, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this isn't\Njust your problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Maximum must have\Nsome kind of purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I would bet it has something to\Ndo with my father's stolen memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be searching for a\Nvery specific thing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find out what if we read the disc
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that's in that scumbag Sports\NMaximum's head. Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should think about getting\Nthe fuck out of this hallway first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll drown in that pipe soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then his stand ability will\Nbe gone along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is off here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there was an invisible\Nalligator corpse. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If it moves, I should be able\Nto locate it through my thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To that invisible\Ncorpse, ceiling or floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,front wall or back wall,\Nit's got us from any angle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not true, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You two aren't the only\Nones in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard ate half of my leg\Nlike it was some afternoon snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's still inside its stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet your ass it's my enemy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, FF! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know where it's hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll bite you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only make it worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It will bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all it knows how to do.\NIts whole reason for being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But see, it's all good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've reached inside his filthy mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually managed to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally took that thing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's part of\Nyour shoulder, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.82,0:06:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure that fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been chopped into a ton of pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, FF, you need this. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hang on. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that creature that attacked and tried\Nto kill us actually an alligator ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And was it also being controlled\Nby Sports Maximum? Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, not a ghost, but\Nan invisible corpse. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The living dead whose primary\Ninstinct is hunting for blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but his terrible power is\Ncreating invisible zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sports Maximum?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he finally drown down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dark, so I can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's stuck deeper down in the pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,These sure as shit look like handprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The back of my throat is\Nall wet, gooey, and sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to gargle, like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I remember what I was doing\Nbefore, and which way was I trying to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was to the chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And my objective, once I'm there,\Nis to find and take that bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you understand this clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail me, I'll be taking\Nback the ability I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and I won't be gentle about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My power, Limp Bizkit, can\Nget the job done, and it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When I possess the bone that\Npale snake ordered me to find,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need to take a rest\Nbefore I do anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to wash this grime off my body\Nand pour something down my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A fresh, cleansing, and\Nrefreshing beverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The skanky, um, what was her name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch will do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The bribe was in my hand, but\Nhe won't even acknowledge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how you doing tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you on duty, so to speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go get a drink right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel like coming to the cafe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can find a nice\Ndark corner somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and have ourselves a\Nlittle old-fashioned fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say to wiping\Neach other's bodies down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't put your fucking\Nhands on me unless I say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to handle the merchandise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the money first!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.32,0:09:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to do anything, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did this slimy little bottom dweller just
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,attempt to touch you and\Nnot even offer to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does Sports Maximum go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe when that zombie-ass\Nalligator was trying to kill us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,he wormed his way out of the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe he somehow transformed\Ninto an invisible corpse himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just kicked you a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot and you won't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:09:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, be an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to earn their\Nrespect or it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You must make them pay\Nor there's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you help me look, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on find his money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a telling\Nbulge in his sleeve, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So you had the cash the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so before jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I literally just told you that\Nyou really are slow aren't you I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder if he's hiding anything\Nelse somewhere in this husk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could find it in here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? So you want me to really\Nright here with you? Yeah, I don't even
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,want to try to figure this out oh no\Nway i have seen enough this is so not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,happening i have done some weird shit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is way off the charts huh hope
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't mind i'll be taking this\Nwhat an excellent find thank Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for sure not drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's oozing from under my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It reeks just like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raw sewage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have actual shit seeping from\Nevery single orifice in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean I actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That is shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right out of the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I was so\Ndesperate for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was truly starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way I could quench this\Nthirst was by eating brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I had already died by drowning\Nin that putrid pipe back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all her fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria Costello's despicable sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare she do that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how dare she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M SO THIRSTY!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that bastard got out of the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do to that poor girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,did he bite her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a pile of bloody flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Can human teeth really\Ndo that much damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's clearly not human\Nanymore, in mind or morals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd be willing to bet he must\Nhave his discs on him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.55,0:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get them from him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Jolene, I want you to go wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! He got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close to me, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been trapped inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He has intelligence, like a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And keep your distance from the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We already went through that shitshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not constrained to the floor I'll\Ntrack his location in the third dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging from the ceiling real clever then\Nyou must have had a bone broken, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with a broken arm right I\Nforgot he's just a rotting corpse now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Notion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't Sports Maxima under there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:14:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He was moving the dead girl's corpse\Nas a decoy, and you bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, stop moving and stay point!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not your battle\Nto fight, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Maximum is my problem, not yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, I told you\Nbefore, we've leveled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This goes way beyond just revenge, or what\Nyou consider your own personal problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not even just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have the time or\Nthe room to even think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:15:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't catch it then, but he already\Nbacked us into a corner a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of the invisible corpses\Nhad already been resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how many or where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find a way out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Survival comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't open the door and\Nescape, these'll be our last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stretch my thread to\Nfull extension and call FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, we back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can collect the discs and\Nget your sweet revenge later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.24,0:15:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know it has to be equally\Nimportant to Sports Maximum,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,who is hiding somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.28,0:15:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants vengeance for my\Nhaving drowned him in the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His mind must have flooded with\Nthoughts of how to retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to chew my head to pulp,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,then drain the blood spewing\Nfrom it until he's sure I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you - The one who'll eventually\Nend me is definitely that bastard himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,with his own foul teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons of people who'd say getting\Nrevenge won't bring your sister back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,as if they understand\Nwhat I'm trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And others who would tell\Nme forgiveness is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd force myself to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That my own blood relative\Nwas thrown into a sewer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and just go on about my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all I've been preparing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can decide my own destiny\Nand finally satisfy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, can you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a standoff, right? You\Ncan't! Get back! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling FF over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's five, no wait, seven corpses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking through the thread\Nand moving in on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone, bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way are you coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, I'm fading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She used a sticker to\Nsplit her head in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my official\Nlicense to avenge. Smack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How predictable you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you did the same thing when\Nyou trapped me in that pipe before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You used that silly sticker\Nthat splits anything in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can see, I won't\Nfall for that power anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I, too, am a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:17:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it. That didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a smart girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your sister's fault she\Nwitnessed an average night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and it cost her everything she had.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to that little incident, now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,after being defeated by you,\Nthis is what I've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And unfortunately, my\Nfeelings will never dissolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this one, for this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I were to suck up your\Nbrain like jelly right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and fill that empty skull that's left\Nwith the shit that's in your stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,my feelings of hatred towards you will\Nstill exist throughout all of eternity,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to say goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that finishes you off is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment she's been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happening now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment he rips off the sticker\Nand attempts to maul her real head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you peel off the sticker,\Nthe two halves will reconjoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the piece that Sports Maxima bit\Noff and swallowed will fuse back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The jig is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've ID'd your exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aiming right above that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The median line of your\Nface, from chin to skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She... she did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This last parting gift is\Nfor Gloria, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There must have been a bone in your\Nugly face that got crushed before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think the way that happened was\NGloria fought back hard against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,is also for Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whip that piece of shit\Nto shreds! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you gonna try to hide again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that anymore, because I\Njust put a sticker on your ugly head!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and split that thing in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I peel this, you'll\Nmerge back into one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This next one is for Gloria too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and the one after that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the next one after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And so on, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all for my Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All for Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, help, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm finally crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.82,0:21:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want right now is to\Nsob my eyes out by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't have time or even a\Nspeck of energy left to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.97,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you! Heal her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Open this gate for me! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:22:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer. A
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Abnormality alert activated Code\Nbuilding 1A Stay right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move or you'll be a stain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate number FE40536.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Full name, Jolene Cujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,After reading that disc, I knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what I need to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.72,0:23:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
